s such as the grenade, boomerang, and the screwdriver, making the balls more difficult to avoid or catch. Options include adjustable time limits for Single Matches and three levels of difficulty.", "themes": [{"id": 32, "name": "Non-fiction"}, {"id": 35, "name": "Kids"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/all-star-slammin-d-ball", "videos": [{"id": 168849, "name": "Gameplay Video", "video_id": "FMHdpRt3tsQ", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FMHdpRt3tsQ", "title": "All Star Slammin D-Ball ... (PS1) Gameplay", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/FMHdpRt3tsQ/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 2194, "name": "Simple 1500"}]}